      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1873 the Colorado Central Railroad cut a 3.3‑mile spur from Forks Creek to Floyd Hill, linking the area to the rail network.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
